  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "Nemotron-Math-v2",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tNemotron-Math-v2\n\t\n\nThis repository contains the dataset accompanying the paper Nemotron-Math: Efficient Long-Context Distillation of Mathematical Reasoning from Multi-Mode Supervision.\nCode: NeMo-Skills\nDocumentation: NeMo-Skills Nemotron-Math-v2 Documentation\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\nNemotron-Math-v2 is a large-scale mathematical reasoning dataset containing approximately 347K high-quality mathematical problems and 7M model-generated reasoning trajectories. The dataset\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/Nemotron-Math-v2.",
